  "notes": "Two same-named entries in a LINKED image were reported with a section-qualified hint, a selector form that only resolves against a relocatable object's section table -- following it gave a second, unrelated error. The candidates were also labelled `synthetic`, which is the relocatable-object wording; these are the addresses the image is mapped at.",
